WEBVTT

00:00:14.177 --> 00:00:16.179
HELLO, HARRY.

00:00:16.223 --> 00:00:18.704
I'VE INTERRUPTED A DEEP THOUGHT,
HAVEN'T I?

00:00:18.747 --> 00:00:20.967
I CAN SEE IT GROWING SMALLER
IN YOUR EYES.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.534
OF COURSE NOT.
HOW ARE YOU, LUNA?
VERY WELL.

00:00:23.578 --> 00:00:25.580
GOT BITTEN BY A GARDEN GNOME
ONLY MOMENTS AGO.

00:00:25.623 --> 00:00:27.234
UH, GNOME SALIVA
IS VERY BENEFICIAL.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.801
[ SMOOCHES ]
XENOPHILIUS LOVEGOOD.

00:00:28.844 --> 00:00:30.628
WE LIVE
JUST OVER THE HILL.

00:00:30.672 --> 00:00:32.326
PLEASURE
TO MEET YOU, SIR.

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:35.068
I trust you know, Mr. Potter,
that we at The Quibbler,

00:00:35.111 --> 00:00:37.679
unlike those toadies
at The Daily Prophet,

00:00:37.723 --> 00:00:40.203
fully supported Dumbledore
in his lifetime

00:00:40.247 --> 00:00:43.467
and, in his death,
support youjust as fully.

00:00:43.511 --> 00:00:45.426
THANK YOU.

00:00:45.469 --> 00:00:46.906
COME, DADDY.

00:00:46.949 --> 00:00:49.169
HARRY DOESN'T WANT TO
TALK TO US RIGHT NOW.

00:00:49.212 --> 00:00:50.910
HE'S JUST TOO POLITE
TO SAY SO.

00:00:50.953 --> 00:00:53.086
HARRY POTTER.

00:00:56.872 --> 00:00:59.483
EXCUSE ME, SIR?
MAY I SIT DOWN?

00:00:59.527 --> 00:01:01.747
MR. POTTER.
BY ALL MEANS.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:04.097
HERE.
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.707
[ SIGHS ]

00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:09.015
UH, I-I FOUND WHAT YOU WROTE
IN THE DAILY PROPHET

00:01:09.058 --> 00:01:10.494
REALLY MOVING.

00:01:10.538 --> 00:01:13.889
YOU OBVIOUSLY
KNEW DUMBLEDORE WELL.

00:01:13.933 --> 00:01:16.413
WELL, I CERTAINLY KNEW HIM
THE LONGEST.

00:01:16.457 --> 00:01:19.503
THAT IS, IF YOU DON'T COUNT
HIS BROTHER, ABERFORTH,

00:01:19.547 --> 00:01:22.768
AND, SOMEHOW, PEOPLE NEVER DO
SEEM TO COUNT ABERFORTH.

00:01:22.811 --> 00:01:25.074
I DIDN'T EVEN KNOW
HE HAD A BROTHER.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:28.686
AH, WELL, DUMBLEDORE WAS ALWAYS
VERY PRIVATE, EVEN AS A BOY.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.776
DON'T DESPAIR, ELPHIAS.

00:01:30.819 --> 00:01:34.605
I'M TOLD HE'S BEEN
THOROUGHLY UNRIDDLED

00:01:34.649 --> 00:01:38.392
BY RITA SKEETER,
IN 800 PAGES, NO LESS.

00:01:38.435 --> 00:01:43.440
WORD HAS IT
THAT SOMEONE TALKED TO HER,

00:01:43.484 --> 00:01:46.400
SOMEONE WHO KNEW
THE DUMBLEDORE FAMILY WELL.

00:01:46.443 --> 00:01:50.404
BOTH YOU AND I KNOW
WHO THAT IS, ELPHIAS.

00:01:50.447 --> 00:01:51.971
A MONSTROUS BETRAYAL.

00:01:53.842 --> 00:01:55.539
UH, WHO ARE --
WHO ARE WE TALKING ABOUT?

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:59.152
BATHILDA BAGSHOT.

00:01:59.195 --> 00:02:01.284
WHO?

00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:04.157
MY GOD, BOY,
SHE'S ONLY THE MOST CELEBRATED

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.855
MAGICAL HISTORIAN
OF THE LAST CENTURY.

00:02:06.899 --> 00:02:11.077
SHE WAS AS CLOSE
TO THE DUMBLEDORES

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.774
AS ANYONE.

00:02:12.818 --> 00:02:15.211
OH,
I'M SURE RITA SKEETER

00:02:15.255 --> 00:02:18.084
THOUGHT IT WELL WORTH A TRIP
TO GODRIC'S HOLLOW

00:02:18.127 --> 00:02:21.478
TO TAKE A PEEK INTO THAT
OLD BIRD'S RATTLED CAGE.

00:02:21.522 --> 00:02:22.915
GODRIC'S HOLLOW?

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:25.700
BATHILDA BAGSHOT
LIVES AT GODRIC'S HOLLOW?

00:02:25.743 --> 00:02:28.181
WELL, THAT'S WHERE SHE FIRST
MET DUMBLEDORE.

00:02:28.224 --> 00:02:30.009
W-- YOU DON'T MEAN TO SAY
HE LIVED THERE, TOO?

00:02:30.052 --> 00:02:31.706
THE FAMILY MOVED THERE

00:02:31.749 --> 00:02:33.926
AFTER HIS FATHER
KILLED THOSE THREE MUGGLES.

00:02:33.969 --> 00:02:37.755
[ CHUCKLING ]
OH, IT WAS QUITE THE SCANDAL.

00:02:37.799 --> 00:02:40.019
HONESTLY, MY BOY,

00:02:40.062 --> 00:02:42.717
ARE YOU SURE
YOU KNEW HIM AT ALL?

00:03:00.604 --> 00:03:04.086
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING,
CROWD GASPING ]

00:03:08.917 --> 00:03:12.312
Shacklebolt: [ Echoing ]
THE MINISTRY HAS FALLEN.

00:03:12.355 --> 00:03:14.967
THE MINISTER OF MAGIC...

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.838
IS DEAD.

00:03:18.448 --> 00:03:21.625
They are coming.

00:03:21.669 --> 00:03:23.932
They are coming.

00:03:23.976 --> 00:03:26.674
They are coming.

00:03:26.717 --> 00:03:28.241
[ INDISTINCT TALKING ]

00:03:30.199 --> 00:03:32.158
NICE MEETING YOU,
MR. POTTER!

00:03:32.201 --> 00:03:34.377
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING,
SCREAMING ]

00:03:34.421 --> 00:03:36.075
[ GLASS SHATTERS ]

00:03:37.728 --> 00:03:39.382
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:39.426 --> 00:03:40.775
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:45.345
GINNY!
HARRY, GO!

00:03:45.388 --> 00:03:46.824
[ GRUNTING ]
GO!

00:03:48.304 --> 00:03:51.220
[ HORN BLARES ]

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:54.223
[ INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS ]

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:57.531
[ SIREN WAILING ]

00:03:57.574 --> 00:03:59.968
[ HORNS HONKING ]

00:04:00.012 --> 00:04:02.753
HERE YOU GO, LOVE,
SIGHTSEEING TOUR?
LEAVES IN 15 MINUTES.

00:04:04.059 --> 00:04:06.670
WHERE ARE WE?SHAFTESBURY AVENUE.

00:04:06.714 --> 00:04:08.890
I USED TO COME TO THE THEATER
HERE WITH MUM AND DAD.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.633
I DON'T KNOW WHY I
THOUGHT OF IT. IT JUST
POPPED INTO MY HEAD.

00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:14.591
Man: HELLO, THERE.THIS WAY.

00:04:14.635 --> 00:04:16.767
WHAT ABOUT THESE?

00:04:16.811 --> 00:04:18.944
[ HORNS HONKING IN DISTANCE ]

00:04:18.987 --> 00:04:21.642
WE NEED TO CHANGE.

00:04:27.387 --> 00:04:28.997
Ron:
HOW THE RUDDY...

00:04:29.041 --> 00:04:32.000
UNDETECTABLE
EXTENSION CHARM.

00:04:32.044 --> 00:04:34.089
YOU'RE AMAZING,
YOU ARE.

00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:36.570
ALWAYS THE TONE
OF SURPRISE.

00:04:36.613 --> 00:04:37.919
[ THUDDING ]

00:04:37.963 --> 00:04:40.661
AH.
THAT'LL BE THE BOOKS.

00:04:42.358 --> 00:04:46.362
[ CLATTERING,
STEAM HISSING ]

00:04:46.406 --> 00:04:48.625
Harry: WHAT ABOUT
ALL THE PEOPLE AT THE WEDDING?

00:04:48.669 --> 00:04:50.192
DO YOU THINK
WE SHOULD GO BACK?

00:04:50.236 --> 00:04:51.672
THEY WERE AFTER YOU,
MATE.

00:04:51.715 --> 00:04:53.282
WE'D PUT EVERYONE IN DANGER
BY GOING BACK.

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:55.328
[ MUSIC PLAYS
THROUGH EARPHONES ]

00:04:55.371 --> 00:04:57.243
RON'S RIGHT.[ CLEARS THROAT ]

00:04:57.286 --> 00:04:58.984
COFFEE?

00:04:59.027 --> 00:05:00.811
A CAPPUCCINO,
PLEASE.

00:05:00.855 --> 00:05:02.726
MM. YOU?

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:05.164
UH,
WHAT SHE SAID.

00:05:05.207 --> 00:05:07.209
SAME.

00:05:10.082 --> 00:05:12.475
SO, WHERE DO WE GO
FROM HERE?

00:05:12.519 --> 00:05:13.781
LEAKY CAULDRON?

00:05:13.824 --> 00:05:15.478
IT'S TOO DANGEROUS.

00:05:15.522 --> 00:05:17.698
IF VOLDEMORT REALLY HAS
TAKEN OVER THE MINISTRY,

00:05:17.741 --> 00:05:19.439
THEN NONE OF THE OLD PLACES
ARE SAFE.

00:05:19.482 --> 00:05:20.788
EVERYONE
FROM THE WEDDING

00:05:20.831 --> 00:05:22.877
WILL HAVE GONE UNDERGROUND,
INTO HIDING.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.836
GOD, MY RUCKSACK WITH
ALL MY THINGS. I'VE
LEFT IT AT THE BURROW.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.014
[ DOOR OPENS, CLOSES ]

00:05:30.798 --> 00:05:32.452
YOU'RE JOKING.

00:05:32.495 --> 00:05:33.931
[ SIGHS ]

00:05:33.975 --> 00:05:36.978
I-I'VE HAD ALL THE ESSENTIALS
PACKED FOR DAYS,

00:05:37.022 --> 00:05:38.458
JUST IN CASE.

00:05:38.501 --> 00:05:40.808
Ron: BY THE WAY,
THESE JEANS -- NOT MY FAVORITE.

00:05:40.851 --> 00:05:42.288
DOWN!

00:05:44.072 --> 00:05:45.421
STUPEFY!

00:05:46.509 --> 00:05:49.512
[ SINGING INDISTINCTLY ]

00:05:49.556 --> 00:05:51.645
EXPULSO!

00:05:59.522 --> 00:06:01.263
[ GRUNTS ]

00:06:01.307 --> 00:06:03.135
PETRIFICUS TOTALUS!

00:06:03.178 --> 00:06:04.440
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:06:04.484 --> 00:06:06.921
[ GLASS CLATTERS ]

00:06:06.964 --> 00:06:09.924
GO! LEAVE!

00:06:12.361 --> 00:06:14.363
[ ALL BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:16.887
LOCK THE DOOR.
GET THE LIGHTS.

00:06:24.721 --> 00:06:26.549
[ GLASS CLATTERING ]

00:06:26.593 --> 00:06:28.421
Harry:
THIS ONE'S NAME'S ROWLE.

00:06:28.464 --> 00:06:29.987
HE WAS ON
THE ASTRONOMY TOWER

00:06:30.031 --> 00:06:31.728
THE NIGHT SNAPE
KILLED DUMBLEDORE.

00:06:31.772 --> 00:06:33.513
THIS IS DOLOHOV.

00:06:33.556 --> 00:06:37.647
I RECOGNIZE HIM
FROM THE WANTED POSTERS.

00:06:37.691 --> 00:06:40.911
SO, WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO
WITH YOU, EH?

00:06:40.955 --> 00:06:43.566
KILL US IF IT WAS TURNED 'ROUND,
WOULDN'T YOU?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.351
IF WE KILL THEM,
THEY'LL KNOW WE WERE HERE.

00:06:45.394 --> 00:06:46.787
RON...

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.658
SUPPOSE HE DID MAD-EYE.

00:06:48.702 --> 00:06:50.617
HOW WOULD YOU FEEL THEN?

00:06:52.793 --> 00:06:54.664
IT'S BETTER
WE WIPE THEIR MEMORIES.

00:06:54.708 --> 00:06:57.319
Ron:
YOU'RE THE BOSS.

00:06:57.363 --> 00:06:59.495
HERMIONE...

00:07:01.802 --> 00:07:03.978
...YOU'RE THE BEST
AT SPELLS.

